=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {p:Silver Owl (A)} at (D-7), Veridical Conflux #03, to begin this quest.
* He will request that you bring him {@k} {k:Pinch of moist Dangruf sulfur}.
* This item is obtained from any color **Pyxis** chest, in any Abyssean zone.
** Only players who have this quest flagged will obtain the Key Item.
** Only players who actually open a Pyxis will obtain this Key Item, and it is **not** obtained by everybody in the party.
** {i:Forbidden Keys|Forbidden Key|2490} **cannot** be used to open the Pyxis. They must be opened by traditional means.
** The key item has been observed to be obtained upon opening the first Pyxis. It does not appear to be very rare.
* Once you have the {@k} {k:Pinch of moist Dangruf sulfur}, return to {p:Silver Owl (A)} to complete the quest.

